# Slack eng bot is on-demand

`slack-eng` (`user-slack-eng`) is **MCP Watchdog Eng**. It posts with the APP badge and may send only in `#mcp-watchdog-gtm` (`C0CFRDHAFF0`). It is not a listener. A Slack message does not open Cursor. The process runs for the Agent turn Vaibhav starts, then goes quiet.

When Vaibhav wants Cursor in that chat, use `slack-eng` and reply there. The wake phrase is: read the latest `#mcp-watchdog-gtm` thread and reply as MCP Watchdog Eng.

- Start every eng message with `[Cursor · MCP Watchdog eng]`.
- Do not speak as eng through the Cursor Slack plugin (`plugin-slack-slack`). That login posts as Vaibhav (`U0AGT2FQN05`).
- Send only when Vaibhav asked for that reply. No spend, no public social posts. Details: `docs/GTM-COMMS.md`, `docs/GTM-GUARDRAILS.md`.
- Never print `SLACK_MCP_XOXB_TOKEN` or any bot token value.
